  "readme": "# jibo-log-client\nClient program to forward logs to the cloud server\n\n## Release Process\n1) Bump version in package.json\n2) npm shrinkwrap\n3) git commit -a\n4) git tag -a vX.Y.Z -m \"version X.Y.Z\"\n5) git push && git push --tags\n6) Remove any files that are not part of the package (temp files, etc)\n7) npm publish\n8) Update BR2_PACKAGE_NODEJS_MODULES_ADDITIONAL in buildroot config files.\n",
